  "body": "**Blocked by:** #91, #82, #83, #89\n\n## Context\n\nThis issue establishes the first implementation slice of the `batch-transcription` batch; #181 builds on it.\n\n## Task\n\nExtend Transcriptions catalog with declared computed keys, status error, and user-owned N:N speakers-to-People relation with edge metadata {speaker:'SPEAKER_00'} via code-level migration. Add Files onItemEvent:create: agents enqueue TASK_NAMES.transcriptionJob with fileItemId/jobKey transcription-job:<id> only for audio/* without Emails.attachments edge, performing no item write. Add POST /api/transcriptions for explicit audio/video/legacy files using same job/key; existing transcription returns 409 transcription_exists with id.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Task deliverables, migrations, integration, tests, and necessary documentation.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- No special upload endpoint or paid pipeline yet.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Standalone audio enqueues once; mail attachment does not.\n- Repeated delivery converges on one job.\n- Explicit video can be requested.\n- Catalog contracts migrate under ownership/archive guards.\n",
